      "kind": "check",
      "necessary": true,
      "established": true,
      "requirement": "The existing CBOR round trip assertion must hold for accepted CBOR values, including NaN.",
      "target_route": "Input bytes f9 7e 00 decode as a half precision NaN, are stored as a floating point JSON value, serialized as a CBOR double, decoded again, and compared.",
      "failure_condition": "Both decoded values contain NaN. JSON equality uses floating point ==, which is false for NaN, so the existing assertion fails.",
      "alternative_paths": "The entry has no guard for NaN. Its exception handlers do not handle a failed assertion.",
